  storyText: "NetWatch Trace\n\nRed text crawls across your HUD: NETWATCH TRACE 37%.\n\nMirage: \"When it hits 100, they burn your brain through your own optics. You need ICE - a ripperdoc can install some - or you need to move fast.\"\n\n1. Find a ripperdoc in Kabuki.\n2. Call Kaz for help.\n3. Ignore it. It's probably fine."
